# CypherFlag

Before answering casually, check `START_HERE.md`.

## Operator may be Aaliya (zero knowledge)
- You run all commands. She only pastes challenges and clicks Allow.
- Follow `AALIYA.md` § Agent duties.

## First run
`bash scripts/first-run.sh`

## On challenge text
1. Save to `challenges/<slug>/README.md`
2. `python3 tools/cypherflag.py autosolve --slug <slug> --text-file challenges/<slug>/README.md`
3. Continue with `.cursor/skills/ctf-*` until `FLAG:`
4. `python3 tools/cypherflag.py save-flag <slug> '<flag>'`

## Tools
Prefer `tools/cypherflag.py` (dig/nmap/curl/recon/web-hunt/autosolve).

## Never
Ask her to use the terminal. Mix challenges in one chat. Attack out of scope. Give up after one try.
